cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "QMBL — the Quantum Many-Body Leaderboard"
message: "If you use this dataset, please cite it and the VarBench paper it builds on."
type: dataset
authors:
  - family-names: Zerweck
    given-names: Tristan
license: Apache-2.0
abstract: >-
  A live record of the best published variational ground-state energies for lattice
  Hamiltonians, ranked by energy, with an explicit bound_type on every row so that
  variational, projected, extrapolated and exact results are never mixed. Builds on
  the VarBench dataset (Wu et al., Science 386, 296 (2024)), Apache-2.0.
references:
  - type: article
    title: "Variational Benchmarks for Quantum Many-Body Problems"
    doi: 10.1126/science.adg9774
    year: 2024
